Production Engineering students should develop strong OR fundamentals."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear programming"},{"text":"Transportation problems"},{"text":"Assignment problems"},{"text":"Integer programming"},{"text":"Queuing theory"},{"text":"Inventory models"},{"text":"Simulation"},{"text":"Decision analysis"},{"text":"Network optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel Solver"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"OR-Tools"},{"text":"MATLAB/other engineering tools where relevant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Production Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Aggregate planning"},{"text":"MRP"},{"text":"Capacity planning"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Inventory optimization"},{"text":"Production sequencing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Demand","Forecast","Capacity","Material Requirement","Production Plan","Scheduling","Execution","Performance Measurement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Maintenance & Reliability"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preventive maintenance"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Corrective maintenance"},{"text":"TPM"},{"text":"MTBF"},{"text":"MTTR"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Failure analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Key metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"MTBF — Mean Time Between Failures"},{"type":"p","text":"MTTR — Mean Time To Repair"},{"type":"p","text":"Use them to evaluate equipment reliability and maintenance performance."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Lean Six Sigma Engineer should be highly comfortable with data."},{"type":"h","text":"Required tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Minitab or equivalent statistical software"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","